The cumulative drop rate of any piece of sunfire fanatic armour if you complete all 12 waves is approximately 1/8.43. 

The cumulative drop rate of at least 1 echo crystal if you complete all 12 waves is approximately 1/12.44. 

The cumulative drop rate of Tonalztics of Ralos if you complete all 12 waves is approximately 1/83.61.

Lastly, completing wave 12 will guarantee [[Dizana's quiver]] from the rewards chest. Additionally, a flat 1/200 chance for the pet [[Smol Heredit]] is rolled. The quiver can later be given to [[Minimus]] for either 4,000 [[sunfire splinter]]s or another 1/200 chance at receiving Smol Heredit.

As wave 1 has a guaranteed drop of 80 sunfire splinters and, depending on the player's gear, can be cleared in about 25-60 seconds, repeatedly clearing the first wave makes for an ideal method of obtaining sunfire splinters for players struggling to consistently clear the higher waves. Those who can clear the entire run, however, will find themselves getting more splinters at a more consistent rate due to the higher drop rates and quantities in the later waves, especially should they choose to exchange their (excess) quivers for splinters.

==Rewards==
On average, players can expect to receive 2014.6 [[Sunfire splinters]] per full completion of the Colosseum, or 6014.6 splinters if [[Dizana's quiver]] is traded in.

